{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Reproduced independently on 2026-11-04 while verifying upset-prissy-olm. make verify's integration tier crashed xdist worker gw2 on test_benchmark_commit_count_is_ceil_per_pass. Run alone: 307.5 s wall (user 15.8 s, sys 28.3 s) on the branch, and 306.9 s (user 13.3 s, sys 23.5 s) on its parent e0ab18822c6 (origin/main), both rc=1 at the 300 s timeout, load average 30-36. The test times out with or without the opcert change, and wall time far exceeds CPU time, which is consistent with waiting on child processes."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793792495268776001,"uuid":"2d37ec5a-a93f-4688-a967-ddd05db0fb95"}